msgid "A few take <0>-akse</0> for “people do”, often with a new stem: <1>tehakse, süüakse, minnakse</1>. Their past still follows the rule: <2>tehti, söödi, mindi</2>."
msgstr "A few take <0>-akse</0> for “people do”, often with a new stem: <1>tehakse, süüakse, minnakse</1>. Their past still follows the rule: <2>tehti, söödi, mindi</2>."

