msgstr "A person, or people in general"

msgid "A whole thing that will get done takes the nominative: <0>uus kool ehitatakse</0>, a new school will be built. While it is going on, for some of something, or after <1>ei</1>, it’s partitive: <2>uut kooli ehitatakse</2>, <3>poes müüakse leiba</3>, <4>poes ei müüda leiba</4>."
msgstr "A whole thing that will get done takes the nominative: <0>uus kool ehitatakse</0>, a new school will be built. While it is going on, for some of something, or after <1>ei</1>, it’s partitive: <2>uut kooli ehitatakse</2>, <3>poes müüakse leiba</3>, <4>poes ei müüda leiba</4>."

